  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free in the DTD parser reachable through\n     parameter-entity references\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-6653.patch: drop the post-inputPush\n       XML_PARSER_EOF early return from xmlPushInput() in parser.c.  It\n       reported an already-halted parser as a push failure after ownership\n       of the input had been transferred, so xmlParsePEReference() freed the\n       input still installed as ctxt->input and xmlParseInternalSubset()\n       read through the dangling pointer.  The flaw is introduced by the\n       CVE-2021-3541 backport, not by the shipped version.\n     - CVE-2026-6653",
